OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy morning with some
OL,6,Fshowers, but these slowly dying out.
OL,7,FDry in the afternoon with bright or
OL,8,Fsunny spells developing. Feeling
OL,9,Frather cool for August.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening with bright
OL,12,Fspells. Becoming cloudy over northeast
OL,13,FAberdeenshire with a few light
OL,14,Fshowers. Dry with clear spells and
OL,15,Frather chilly in the southwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA chilly start then a mainly
OL,18,Fdry and bright day. Just the odd light
OL,19,Fshower possible, mainly in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
